Hi Karine,

長寬資料轉換請參考使用 tidyr 或 reshape2 套件, 折線圖第1條線可用 plot(, type="l")，其他資料用 lines( )加上:

 <https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sjDadOcNYew/V_z-pWI2nxI/AAAAAAAAKyA/WGyA-ABtxcE_HILfLr9NwAGwVe4KhE_YgCLcB/s1600/%25E5%25A6%2582%25E4%25BD%2595%25E7%2595%25AB%25E5%2580%258B%25E5%2588%25A5%25E5%2580%258B%25E6%25A1%2588%25E7%259A%2584%25E6%258A%2598%25E7%25B7%259A%25E5%259C%2596-%25E9%2595%25B7%25E5%25AF%25AC%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E8%25BD%2589%25E6%258F%259B.png>

# title: 如何畫個別個案的折線圖, 本例為長資料轉換為寬資料
# date: 2016.10.11

mydata <- read.csv("data_r.csv")

# method 1
library(tidyr)
# gather 寬資料轉換為長資料
# spread 長資料轉換為寬資料

mydatawide1 <- spread(mydata, casename, score, fill=0)
mydatawide1

# method 2
library(reshape2)
# melt  寬資料轉換為長資料
# dcast 長資料轉換為寬資料

mydatawide2 <- dcast(mydata, time ~ casename, value.var="score", fill=0)
mydatawide2
# end

